t;P1 ON" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#212121;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeWidth=2.5;" vertex="1" parent="chain"><mxGeometry x="1032" y="120" width="92" height="96" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ch_f1" value="W24-01 · br. F1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E53935;fontColor=#E53935;fontSize=9;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="chain"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="250" width="80" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hw_cf132" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#E53935;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="L10" source="ch_f1" target="ch_lc1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ch_sys" value="from SYSCTRL CAN · W25 · 1.8 m → LC-10" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#3949AB;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="chain"><mxGeometry x="60" y="50" width="330" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hw_cs133" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#3949AB;strokeWidth=2.5;exitX=0.1;exitY=1;entryX=0.3;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="L10" source="ch_sys" target="ch_lc10"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ch_end" value="120 Ω" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#3949AB;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;horizontal=0;" vertex="1" parent="chain"><mxGeometry x="1146" y="150" width="28" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ch_txt" value="• Physical CAN order MAINCTRL → SYSCTRL → LC-10 → … → LC-01 (end, P1 = 120 Ω). All other LANECTRL: P1 off. W26 ×9 short links (0.3 m each, R27 estimate).&lt;br&gt;• Each LC-nn also gets its own fused 24 V pair W24-nn from SYSCTRL (R27 branch IDs F1…F10) — ten separate pairs, not a shared bus. &lt;font color=&quot;#B71C1C&quot;&gt;⚠ SYSCTRL R1 has six fused headers (board fuses F1–F3, F5–F7, 4 A) + one eFuse header (J7): ten row feeds are not yet provided.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• At every J8 plug the incoming and outgoing CAN pairs share pins 3 / 4 (see ⚠ on the LANECTRL box). Label each plug with its row number; set S1 node ID = row number." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#212121;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;connectable=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="chain"><mxGeometry x="10" y="282" width="1160" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hw_w134" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=6;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#546E7A;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#546E7A;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;" edge="1" parent="L11" source="mrk_d" target="m_mrk"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="hw_w135" value="PWR (TBC)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=6;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#E53935;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#E53935;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=2 3;" edge="1" parent="L11" source="mrk_p" target="sy_mrk"><mxGeometry x="0.1" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="668" y="590" /><mxPoint x="668" y="680" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="hw_p136" value="⑪ W19" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;fontColor=#9E9E9E;spacing=1;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="L11"><mxGeometry x="646" y="516" width=